{"3918860": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "I'm Tripping", "steam_appid": 3918860, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got high and woke up in the middle of space with a smoke shop to run. No idea how you got here, but aliens are lining up for blunts, bongs, and bizarre substances. Scavenge secondhand marketplaces, find good deals on used items, and flip them to cosmic customers. Grow strange intergalactic plants, manufacture your own drugs, and craft everything from Pre-Rolls to wax pens and edibles. Keep the aliens high, keep the cash flowing. Just don’t forget to trip</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—every substance is a gamble, every hallucination a game. Some trips will break you. Others will make you rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/ec160b294061b48dbf150a8d2a4e81da.poster.avif?t=1786373366\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/ec160b294061b48dbf150a8d2a4e81da.webm?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/ec160b294061b48dbf150a8d2a4e81da.mp4?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy</strong> a wide range of used items—some can be flipped directly to aliens for quick profit, others serve as key ingredients in drug manufacturing. Learn what’s worth reselling and what’s better cooked into something <strong>stronger</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/bcc7aed484d8a1e0fd109322eb09eeb7.poster.avif?t=1786373366\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/bcc7aed484d8a1e0fd109322eb09eeb7.webm?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/bcc7aed484d8a1e0fd109322eb09eeb7.mp4?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell.</strong> Flip secondhand finds for quick profit or move your own handcrafted stash of intergalactic drugs. Aliens <strong>love</strong> that stuff—and they pay good money for a good trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/99593cab546b35d8e377df1bb47303b0.poster.avif?t=1786373366\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/99593cab546b35d8e377df1bb47303b0.webm?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/99593cab546b35d8e377df1bb47303b0.mp4?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manufacture.</strong> Create everything from Pre-Rolls to potent alien edibles using resources purchased or discovered in unexpected places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a53debb89a9d0399fdc2f7a1e0d4d84f.poster.avif?t=1786373366\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a53debb89a9d0399fdc2f7a1e0d4d84f.webm?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a53debb89a9d0399fdc2f7a1e0d4d84f.mp4?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant. </strong>Grow bizarre intergalactic flora like LSD plants, bong plants, and Pre-Roll plants. You’ll need to get the seeds first—maybe you’ll win them in a high-stakes alien poker game, or score them from shady darknet marketplaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a650aec9a975821a30e3364c28c2a40a.poster.avif?t=1786373366\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a650aec9a975821a30e3364c28c2a40a.webm?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a650aec9a975821a30e3364c28c2a40a.mp4?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trip.</strong> The heart of the hustle. Every trip is a high-stakes game—alien poker, spin the bong, mushroom roulette. Bet big, and the aliens will match it. Win rare items to expand your empire… or lose it all in a cosmic flash. What’s it gonna be, hooman?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You got high and woke up in the middle of space with a smoke shop to run. No idea how you got here, but aliens are lining up for blunts, bongs, and bizarre substances. Scavenge secondhand marketplaces, find good deals on used items, and flip them to cosmic customers. Grow strange intergalactic plants, manufacture your own drugs, and craft everything from Pre-Rolls to wax pens and edibles. Keep the aliens high, keep the cash flowing. Just don’t forget to trip</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >—every substance is a gamble, every hallucination a game. Some trips will break you. Others will make you rich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/ec160b294061b48dbf150a8d2a4e81da.poster.avif?t=1786373366\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/ec160b294061b48dbf150a8d2a4e81da.webm?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/ec160b294061b48dbf150a8d2a4e81da.mp4?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy</strong> a wide range of used items—some can be flipped directly to aliens for quick profit, others serve as key ingredients in drug manufacturing. Learn what’s worth reselling and what’s better cooked into something <strong>stronger</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/bcc7aed484d8a1e0fd109322eb09eeb7.poster.avif?t=1786373366\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/bcc7aed484d8a1e0fd109322eb09eeb7.webm?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/bcc7aed484d8a1e0fd109322eb09eeb7.mp4?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell.</strong> Flip secondhand finds for quick profit or move your own handcrafted stash of intergalactic drugs. Aliens <strong>love</strong> that stuff—and they pay good money for a good trip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/99593cab546b35d8e377df1bb47303b0.poster.avif?t=1786373366\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/99593cab546b35d8e377df1bb47303b0.webm?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/99593cab546b35d8e377df1bb47303b0.mp4?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manufacture.</strong> Create everything from Pre-Rolls to potent alien edibles using resources purchased or discovered in unexpected places.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a53debb89a9d0399fdc2f7a1e0d4d84f.poster.avif?t=1786373366\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a53debb89a9d0399fdc2f7a1e0d4d84f.webm?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a53debb89a9d0399fdc2f7a1e0d4d84f.mp4?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plant. </strong>Grow bizarre intergalactic flora like LSD plants, bong plants, and Pre-Roll plants. You’ll need to get the seeds first—maybe you’ll win them in a high-stakes alien poker game, or score them from shady darknet marketplaces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a650aec9a975821a30e3364c28c2a40a.poster.avif?t=1786373366\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a650aec9a975821a30e3364c28c2a40a.webm?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/extras/a650aec9a975821a30e3364c28c2a40a.mp4?t=1786373366\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trip.</strong> The heart of the hustle. Every trip is a high-stakes game—alien poker, spin the bong, mushroom roulette. Bet big, and the aliens will match it. Win rare items to expand your empire… or lose it all in a cosmic flash. What’s it gonna be, hooman?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "You woke up high in space with a smoke shop to run. Buy second-hand items from weird intergalactic beings, grow mysterious plants, craft drugs, and flip it all to aliens. From Pre-Rolls to edibles —keep them high, keep the cash flowing. And rule number one: get high on your own supply.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/cd5284843cf750371f003ac9a6a857818e96a7f9/header.jpg?t=1786373366", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/a449f482e3dca14672a5d7385c197060a8cf25db/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786373366", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918860/a449f482e3dca14672a5d7385c197060a8cf25db/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786373366", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong>  Windows 10 (64-bit)<br><